      ],
      "text": "6/ so we won't see what would happen if you spent $100B of GPUs on a model for a while because of how spread out the GPU distributions are.\n\nwe'd likely need to see $500B of aggregate GPU spend to have an individual model trained on $100B of GPUs (wow!)",
