      ],
      "text": "5/ there is another factor—which is that the $100B is spread between multiple labs.\n\nthe largest labs (Google, OpenAI, Meta, Anthropic, etc.) may only have 10-20% of the total GPU supply from NVDA\n\n(sidenote: Google is the hardest to track because they use TPUs as well as GPUs) https://t.co/hfcoO8TauE",
