        "text": "Is China Really Two Years Behind the US in AI with @alexandr_wang tomorrow on 20VC: \n\n“The CCPs approach to industrial policy is not the most innovative but once an industry has been established and it’s about turning the crank; they are better at turning the crank than any https://t.co/90KfBrXtBi"
      },
      {
