          "like_count": 15203,
          "quote_count": 414,
          "reply_count": 391,
          "retweet_count": 2147
        },
        "text": "📽️ New 4 hour (lol) video lecture on YouTube:\n\"Let’s reproduce GPT-2 (124M)\"\nhttps://t.co/NMIVD1V6zr\n\nThe video ended up so long because it is... comprehensive: we start with empty file and end up with a GPT-2 (124M) model:\n- first we build the GPT-2 network \n- then we optimize https://t.co/NDqTrLbrO4"
      },
      {
        "author_id": "1658958333603184644",
        "created_at": "2024-06-09T23:42:27.000Z",
        "edit_history_tweet_ids": [
          "1799950216822403378"
